 Black to waste tempo on king safety or pawn structure (e.g., ...d6). This accelerates White's initiative while developing a piece to a strong square. The Ruy Lopez-inspired move also pressures the queenside and avoids passive play, maximizing winning chances early.\n\nAnswer: B: f1-b5"}
